&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getdbt.com/&quot;&gt;dbt&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/&quot;&gt; BigQuery SQL&lt;/a&gt; for our data modelling and warehousing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for data science and machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://golang.org/&quot;&gt;Go&lt;/a&gt; to write our application code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://aws.amazon.com/&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/a&gt; for most of our backend infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
