&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Payments team ⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, payments are more than just moving money from A to B. They are a core part of how customers experience trust, speed, and financial control every day. As a Data Director in Payments, you would help shape seamless local payment experiences, ensuring customers can pay and get paid reliably while continuing to modernise the infrastructure that powers millions of transactions behind the scenes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role also sits at the intersection of Monzo’s broader ambition to build truly borderless banking and expand into new markets. That means designing products and payment capabilities that work effortlessly across geographies, currencies, and customer needs, while helping Monzo scale into new markets with the same simplicity and transparency that defines the brand today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Design to help shape Monzo’s payments strategy to make Monzo&#39;s global ambitions a reality, enabling revenue and customer growth with a resilient, self-serve banking platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed, you should be excited about solving tough, ambiguous business problems with analytical rigour, commercial viability and execution effectiveness&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day-to-day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish yourself as a trusted member of the Payments Leadership team, enabling better decisions across Payments and the wider Data Discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-drive Payments strategy and product decisions with Product and Engineering, bringing Data into discovery early to shape priorities and challenge thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify untapped opportunities for commercial optimisation, including across pricing, commercialisation, investment and customer growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the data strategy for Payments, including the operating model, team priorities, architecture, technical debt and key metrics and drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate between technical, product and commercial perspectives to help teams make clear, high-impact decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale a high-performing team of data professionals sharing accountability for product and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
