&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;todk6r&quot; data-start=&quot;4566&quot; data-end=&quot;4606&quot;&gt;45-minute call with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hpj58m&quot; data-start=&quot;4607&quot; data-end=&quot;4657&quot;&gt;3 x 1-hour video calls with various team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4659&quot; data-end=&quot;4844&quot;&gt;Our average process takes around 3–4 weeks, but we&#39;ll always work around your availability. You&#39;ll have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1p19p2y&quot; data-start=&quot;4846&quot; data-end=&quot;4870&quot;&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4872&quot; data-end=&quot;4909&quot;&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4911&quot; data-end=&quot;4933&quot;&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4935&quot; data-end=&quot;5067&quot;&gt;📍 This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK, with ad hoc meetings in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5069&quot; data-end=&quot;5196&quot;&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
