&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;📍This role can be based in our London or Barcelona offices, but we&#39;re also open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
