&lt;li&gt;Identify and unlock new commercial opportunities across customer segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex trade-offs between growth, risk, and customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive commercial performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
