&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ About our Business Banking Sales team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are rapidly growing and now serve over 730,000 businesses in the UK 🇬🇧&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to support the next phase of our expansion, we’re hiring a small team of experienced &lt;strong&gt;Sales Account Executives&lt;/strong&gt;, whose mission is to reach out and support more complex high value customers with a personalised experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building an acquisition engine and your job will be to work with small-medium business (SMB) prospective customers, guide them through their buying journey, work with them to activate their account and bring all their banking needs to Monzo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to be a part of the founding sales team for a mission driven company , which is changing how people and businesses bank.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
