&lt;li&gt;Driving full sales cycle, from early prospecting and qualification; to demos and sales;&amp;nbsp; to ensuring successful account switch and activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guiding customers through Monzo’s business banking offerings - providing clear, factual information and helping them evaluate what works best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a product expert: fully understand Monzo&#39;s business banking products, features and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a pipeline of leads with strong attention to data hygiene: timely follow-ups, accurate forecasting, deal tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving activation: not just closing, but ensuring new business customers are fully set up, onboarded, and are using Monzo for their banking needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating internally: work closely with marketing, product, risk and customer operations to ensure a smooth journey for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering outstanding service at every touchpoint: via phone, video, email or digital channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieving sales targets: conversion, activations, revenue, engagement and other growth metrics as set by the commercial leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feeding insights back: capture and share customer feedback — customer pain points, required features, suggestions for product improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapting &amp;amp; iterate: Things will change rapidly and often - you’ll need to be comfortable with ambiguity and change and help support what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if you...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in Small Business sales, ideally selling business solutions or financial services; knowing how to engage business customers and understand their mindset, needs and pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a proven track record of meeting (or exceeding) sales quotas / targets in a performance-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an expert at managing a full sales cycle: from prospecting to activation, including structured and rigorous outreach and follow-ups and cross-team coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have high emotional intelligence and are able to quickly connect and build a relationship with customers of diverse backgrounds and levels of knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strategic communicator,&amp;nbsp; excellent at building trust and helping customers discover value - you’re consultative, you listen, you ask insightful questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are adaptable and resilient, you embrace change and have a strong winning mindset to see challenges as opportunities to learn and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can communicate clearly: written, verbal, via video; you simplify complex topics for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are coachable and comfortable seeking constructive criticism to empower continuous learning and improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working in a fast-moving, high change environment. You thrive when things aren’t fully defined yet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can demonstrate high levels of personal organisation: tracking your pipeline, managing your time, prioritising your leads and follow-up tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have integrity and strong consumer duty awareness: regulatory compliance, knowing your customer, reducing risk, safeguarding data and ensuring we put consumer duty first are foundational to this role and our culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus / Nice-to-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a regulated environment (banking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SMBs in specific verticals (e.g. food &amp;amp; drink, professional services, construction)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
