&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;➕And much more, see our full list of benefits &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you prefer to work part-time, we&#39;ll make this happen whenever we can - whether this is to help you meet other commitments or strike a great work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
